<title>POLAND: GORAZDZE JULY NET FALLS TO PLN 4.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>GORAZDZE JULY NET FALLS TO PLN 4.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     4.29 vs   9.09</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.71 vs   9.11</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.90 vs   9.34</p>
<p> Sales		   25.61 vs  29.93</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	    30.38 vs  28.21</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	30.48 vs  28.27</p>
<p> Operating profit    24.88 vs  16.86</p>
<p> Sales		  149.29 vs 119.39</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish cement firm is Zaklady</p>
<p>Cementowo-Wapiennicze Gorazdze SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
